   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "i2 Cutter: ComfyUI as an assistant editor. It doesn't generate a single pixel.\n\n1. Footage Bin: point it at a folder of clips (or one long master). It splits files into shots and measures motion. Results are cached.\n2. Music Map: your track, where to start and how long the cut is. The beat map shows bars (white), accents (red) and energy (yellow).\n3. Shot Scorer: one story beat per line. CLIP (local) scores every shot against every line. First run downloads the model into ComfyUI/models/i2_cutter.\n4. Cut Planner: lays shots onto the beat grid. Change the seed for another version of the cut.\n5. Timeline Export: writes an FCP 7 XML (Premiere: File > Import; Resolve: File > Import > Timeline), an EDL, a cut list and a preview MP4 into ComfyUI/output/i2_cutter.\n\nRed 'NEEDS SHOTS' markers in the timeline = lines of the brief your footage doesn't cover well. Generate those, drop them in the folder, run again."
   ]
  }
